Integration of PS-JEPA into StructTokenBench.

Base commit: 2681b240f6a1060291be654c743649d8bfa3985e
Upstream:    https://github.com/KatarinaYuan/StructTokenBench (MIT License,
             Copyright (c) 2025 Xinyu Yuan)

Adds PS-JEPA tokenizer integration, representation-aware feature caching,
validation-based head selection and metrics output for downstream evaluation.

Apply with:
    scripts/structtokenbench/apply_patch.sh /path/to/StructTokenBench

